  "title": "Easy Baked Chicken Tenders",
  "description": "These crispy baked chicken tenders are breaded with seasoned panko crumbs for that extra crunch factor. Baking means there&#39;s no guilt of frying!",
  "authors": [
    "Tarryn"
  ],
